    "answer": {
      "short": "$-32$, using $(-8)\\times4$.",
      "worked": "A negative product is less than a positive product, so choose factors with different signs. The greatest available magnitudes are $8$ for a negative factor and $4$ for a positive factor.\n\n$$\\begin{align*}8\\times4&=32\\\\(-8)\\times4&=-32\\end{align*}$$\n\nThe least product is $-32$.",
